sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant V as Viewer.razor.cs
  participant SA as DxfServerAdapter
  participant R as DxfSkiaRendererFast
  participant API as app-server (nginx 경유)
  participant C as ChatClientBackgroundService
  V->>SA: Reload →<br/>FetchSceneAsync("/api/dxf")
  SA->>API: Accept:<br/>application/x-msgpack (ETag)
  API-->>SA: DxfSceneDto<br/>(MessagePack+LZ4)
  SA-->>V: scene
  V->>R: LoadFromScene → 엔티티 캐시<br/>· AssignDockIndices
  loop 2초 StartStatsPolling
    V->>API: GET<br/>/api/ProcessCount/live/latest-n-minutes
    V->>R: SetJudgeMap<br/>(소/중/대/이형 비율 → 색)
  end
  loop 1초 StartDockStatusPolling
    V->>API: GET /api/Dock/status
    V->>V: ApplyDockStatusCompactFrame<br/>→ ElementState
  end
  loop 1초 StartAlarmPolling
    V->>API: POST<br/>/api/EventLog/search/fast
  end
  C--)V: Heartbeat / ServerStatus<br/>/ CollectedCount (SignalR)
  V->>R: OnPaint → Render(zoom, pan)<br/>또는 DockStatusDiagramRenderer
